Generative AI is typically
built into software application

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:30.270
and uses large language model
trained on huge volumes of text

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:34.830
to generate human-like natural
language responses and,

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:38.760
in some cases, even
original images.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:43.110
You now have the essentials:
what generative AI is,

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:48.660
what large language model
do, what Azure OpenAI is,

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:52.980
what Copilots are, and how
prompt engineering helps you

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:55.810
improve the response
that you get.

