00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:50.910
The idea is simple.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:54.090
You don't have to leave
the tool you're already

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:58.920
in to start using
AI-assisted summaries,

00:16:58.920 --> 00:17:01.260
guidance, or analysis.

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:06.340
You start where you are, and
Copilot helps you move faster.

